sentences.l:
“Dear nurse, mad you the gods have made, who are able
to make foolish even one very thoughtful,
and who set even the light-minded upon sound-mindedness;

sentences.t:
τίπτε με λωβεύεις πολυπενθέα θυμὸν ἔχουσαν
ταῦτα παρὲξ ἐρέουσα καὶ ἐξ ὕπνου μ’ ἀνεγείρεις
ἡδέος, ὅς μ’ ἐπέδησε φίλα βλέφαρ’ ἀμφικαλύψας;

sentences.l:
So she spoke, and she rejoiced and from her bed leaping
clung to the old woman, and from her eyelids a tear she sent;
and, lifting her voice, to her winged words she spoke:

But now they all at the courtyard doors
together are, while he is fumigating the house, very fair,
having kindled a great fire;

“My child, what a word has escaped you, the fence of your teeth,
you who your husband, though within, by the hearth never said
would come home;

And she, when she entered and stepped over the stone threshold,
sat then opposite Odysseus, in the light of the fire,
by the other wall;
